1. Collect daggers - up to 20. plain daggers or elven if you happen to
find that many and if neither then orcish. Once you're skilled 2xd4 per
round is as good and virtually any weapon, and you can become expert
which is max 3 per round. 

2. keep your quarterstaff until you get a +2 or better weapon or a
morningstar or you can become skilled in or an artifact. 

3. Wear (in order of preference): dragon mail, Dwarf mithril, elvish
mithril, studded leather, chain. *always* keep your cloak over top. (yes
I know that limits casting, but it keeps you alive if you get caught in
combat. 

4. Read your books sparingly, not just when it becomes unknown, but when
you *know* you'll need it. Try to keep one 1st level in each sphere to
gain abilities. 

5. Don't worry about identifing anything but identify, enchant armor and
weapon and remove curse until you have done both sokoban and the mines. 

6. Only use blessed identify scrolls.

